        "content": "<p>Changed Util.roc to and it worked:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Ruby\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"no\">Util</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[].</span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">extract_oneliner</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"no\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">extract_oneliner</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">prefix</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lst</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">pref</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\".\"</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">concat</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">prefix</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">..]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">starts_with</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">Ok</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">drop_prefix</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">trim</span><span class=\"p\">())</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">Err</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"no\">PrefixNotFound</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">Err</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"no\">ListHasNoHeading</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">expect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"TL\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">extract_oneliner</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\".TL Hello\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">)?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">Str</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Hello\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">expect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"TL\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">extract_oneliner</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\".TA Hello\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">Try</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"no\">Err</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"no\">PrefixNotFound</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">expect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"TL\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">extract_oneliner</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">Try</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"no\">Err</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"no\">ListHasNoHeading</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">functions</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">lines_lists</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">List</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">join_map</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">list_list</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">functions</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">join_map</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">list_list</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">expect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[|</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"B\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"C\"</span><span class=\"o\">]]</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">List</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"B\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"C\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">expect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[|</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">List</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">lines_lists</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">input_lines</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">aux</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">acc</span><span class=\"o\">|</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">acc</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">aux</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">acc</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">aux</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">input_lines</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">expect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lines_lists</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">List</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">[[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">]]</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Is this kind of practice not encouraged or allowed? I mean writing the functions outside the scope and exporting them like this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>Util :: [].{\n    extract_oneliner = extract_oneliner\n    apply = apply\n}\n\nextract_oneliner .....\nappply ....\n</code></pre></div>",
